<MediaContainer offset="0" totalSize="16" identifier="tv.plex.provider.epg" size="16"><Video guid="plex://episode/6a41bc7dda6509806e9cbdd7" key="/library/metadata/6a41bc7dda6509806e9cbdd7" ratingKey="6a41bc7dda6509806e9cbdd7" summary="Pat and his wife, Sarah, claim they’re scared for their family’s safety. Pat claims his father, John, is delusional, violent, paranoid and so dangerous, that Pat sleeps on the couch in his living room to protect his wife and two children in the event that John comes to the house at night to harm them. Pat and Sarah say John’s delusions have gotten so bad they’ve had to cut ties with him. John, on the other hand, completely denies the allegations. He says his daughter-in-law is to blame for stealing his son, filling his head with evil and turning Pat against him. Can Dr. Phil bridge the gap between father and son and bring this whole family back together again?" type="episode" contentRating="TV-14" duration="2700000" grandparentArt="https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7L9GovbKdgyTW81Mi6DqW4rWuNW.jpg" grandparentGuid="plex://show/611e2d860faece002cd7499d" grandparentKey="/library/metadata/66e4cbefd8c8d1be9ef71181" grandparentRatingKey="66e4cbefd8c8d1be9ef71181" grandparentThumb="https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sPc9ncT29GSpuZTWAAm407FenyX.jpg" grandparentTitle="Dr. Phil" grandparentType="show" index="35" originallyAvailableAt="2016-07-11T00:00:21Z" parentIndex="14" requiresConsent="1" skipParent="1" thumb="https://ingest-assets.wurl.com/428498/219175647-0.jpeg" title="Scared Of My Own Father Part 1" userState="0" year="2016"><Image alt="Scared Of My Own Father Part 1" type="background" url="https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7L9GovbKdgyTW81Mi6DqW4rWuNW.jpg"/><Image alt="Scared Of My Own Father Part 1" type="backgroundSquare" url="https://metadata-static.plex.tv/d/gracenote/decba2a31755ebf778b55eb3b6683782.jpg"/><Image alt="Scared Of My Own Father Part 1" type="banner" url="https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/series/408876/banners